        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MM2001, Stainless Steel MM Series Toilet Tissue Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Single Post Stainless Steel Toilet Paper Holder is available in several modern finish color options. With a stainless steel base metal, you can be sure it will stand the test of time. This Stainless Steel MM Series Toilet Tissue Holder comes packaged with the mounting hardware. It features a sleek, angular design will update your home. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana MM Series\"><b>Deltana MM Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the MM Single Post \"L\" Shaped Toilet Paper Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 5-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Length: 2-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MM2001-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262429\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MM2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
